  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {宅配便|たくはいびん}を{受|う}け{取|と}る: to receive a delivery\n- {宅配便|たくはいびん}で{送|おく}る: to send by courier\n- {再配達|さいはいたつ}を{頼|たの}む: to request redelivery\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\nJapan has an efficient delivery system with options for time-slot delivery and easy redelivery scheduling via phone or app.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {配達|はいたつ}: delivery\n- {荷物|にもつ}: package, luggage\n- {不在票|ふざいひょう}: missed delivery notice",
